<title>UK: Pearson up on NatWest comments.</title>
<headline>Pearson up on NatWest comments.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Pearson Plc firmed 6p to 713-1/2p on Friday as NatWest reiterated its bullish stance on the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>The brokerage repeated its long-standing &quot;add&quot; recommendation, forecasting a rise in the stock price to 825p.</p>
<p>NatWest declined to provide details</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
